{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>Take them.</b> The meaning concerns those who were joined to Baal, and the proof is that it is written, \"And Moses said to the judges of Israel.\"" "<b>Take them.</b> Like ויוקיעם בהר (impaled them on the mountain), in the words of the Aramaic translator. And the proof is נגד השמש (before the sun); the meaning is in public, like לעיני השמש הזאת (before the eyes of this sun)."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {0 "The comment addresses the word והוקע; Ibn Ezra reads the lamed of לה' as indicating attachment to Baal-peor."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:19:29.092796204Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}